## Text Document Format (`markdown`, `YAML`, `CSV`)

{# lede #}This page documents the Header fields and resulting Data Artifacts{# lede #} produced by the [Build API](build) when processing  such text files via its [`single_narrative`](https://www.sunstarsys.com/orion/api/build#-code-single_narrative-args-code-) view.

[TOC]

### `Markdown`

#### Headers

##### `title`

##### `status`

##### `acl`

##### `dependencies`

##### `keywords`

##### `categories`

#### Data Artifacts

n/a

### `YAML`

#### Headers

##### `title`

##### `status`

##### `acl`

#### Data Artifacts

##### `content`

`YAML::XS::Load` parsed data structure

### `CSV`

#### Headers

##### `title`

##### `status`

##### `acl`

##### `column_ids`

Comma-separated list of Column Ids for `PDL`

##### `datetime`

strptime(1) format for `PDL` processing

##### `type`

Declared `PDL` column data types

#### Data Artifacts

##### `content`

`arrayref` of either `arrayrefs` (no `csv` headers), or `hashrefs` (`csv` headers)

##### `csv`

[`Text::CSV` ](https://metacpan.org/pod/Text::CSV) object used to produce above

##### `pdl`

Full [`PDL`](https://metacpan.org/pod/PDL) object generated by header configuration

